{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Observations.S5EquivariantTorusKnots","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Observations.S5EquivariantTorusKnots","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.SpecificGroups.Cyclic","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Cycle.Type"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.s5_equivariant_classification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.s5_equivariant_classification","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/s5-equivariant-torus-knots.lean#L34-L55","doc":"**S_5-equivariant torus-knot classification**:\nT_{2,s} (s ≥ 3, gcd(2,s) = 1, i.e. s odd) embeds equivariantly\ninto a Riemann surface with automorphism group S_5 iff\ns ∈ {3, 5}.\n\nThe proof reduces to finding an element of order s in S_5.\nBy the orders-in-S_5 table, odd orders ≥ 3 are exactly {3, 5}.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:s5-equivariant-torus-knots}`\nRef: [leitner2026] Chapter 7, §Particle identification conjectures ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.s5OddOrdersGe3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.s5OddOrdersGe3","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/s5-equivariant-torus-knots.lean#L29-L32","doc":"Odd element orders ≥ 3 that occur in S_5.\nBy inspection of s5ElementOrders: {3, 5}. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.s5ElementOrders","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.s5ElementOrders","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/s5-equivariant-torus-knots.lean#L22-L27","doc":"The set of element orders that occur in S_5.\nCycle types of S_5 partitions and their LCMs:\n  (1)^5 → 1, (2)(1)^3 → 2, (2)^2(1) → 2, (3)(1)^2 → 3,\n  (3)(2) → 6, (4)(1) → 4, (5) → 5. ","signatureChunk":0}]}